questions.scenario:
You are debugging a production issue where a high-throughput Spring Boot gateway service encounters intermittent `ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException` and lost elements under heavy load. A code review reveals the following custom collection-based aggregation logic inside a singleton service:

java
@Service
public class UserSessionTracker {
    private final ConcurrentHashMap<String, List<String>> activeUserTokens = new ConcurrentHashMap<>();

    public void trackSession(String userId, String token) {
        activeUserTokens.computeIfAbsent(userId, k -> new ArrayList<>())
                        .add(token);
    }

    public List<String> getSessions(String userId) {
        return activeUserTokens.getOrDefault(userId, Collections.emptyList());
    }
}
